; A `)` lost inside a declaration used to swallow every declaration after it and
; surface as one `SL0004` at the end of the file, pointing hundreds of lines up.
; A `|)` forces the depth to zero, so the loss cannot leave the declaration it
; was written in: what is reported is this `if`, and `second` and `main` below
; are read as the declarations they are (`D-151`).
(fn first ((value i64)) -> i64
  (if (> value 0 1 0|)

(fn second () -> i64 2)

(fn main () -> i32 0)
